flowchart TD
    A[User Input: Job URL] --> B[Ingress Layer]
    B --> B1[Telegram / Web App / API]
    B1 --> C[Create or Load Session]

    C --> D[Orchestrator]
    D --> E[Job Intelligence MCP]
    E --> E1[get_llm_text_for_this_url]
    E1 --> F[Structured Content: llm_input_text]

    F --> G[LLM Job Understanding]
    G --> G1[Extract key requirements]
    G --> G2[Identify responsibilities]
    G --> G3[Detect seniority / skills]

    D --> H[Resume Source Loader]
    H --> H1[Existing Resume]
    H --> H2[Profile / Known Answers]
    H --> H3[LaTeX Template]

    G --> I[Resume Tailoring LLM]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Tailored Resume Data]

    J --> K[Document Engine]
    K --> K1[Render .tex]
    K1 --> K2[Generate PDF]

    D --> L[Application Engine]
    L --> L1[Open Job Application]
    L1 --> L2[Fill Known Fields]
    L2 --> L3[Upload Tailored Resume]

    L3 --> M{Unknown Question?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Persist Session State]
    N --> O[Send User Prompt]
    O --> O1[Telegram / Web App]
    O1 --> P[User Reply]
    P --> Q[Resume Session]
    Q --> D

    M -- No --> R{Ready to Submit?}
    R -- No --> L2
    R -- Yes --> S[Final Review Summary]
    S --> T[User Confirmation]

    T --> U{Approved?}
    U -- No --> V[Abort / Save Draft]
    U -- Yes --> W[Submit Application]
    W --> X[Audit Log]
    X --> X1[Store answers]
    X --> X2[Store artifacts]
    X --> X3[Store status / screenshots]
